				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA[$F{second_url} == null ? "No file" : "Download PDF"]]></textFieldExpression>
				<hyperlinkReferenceExpression><![CDATA[$F{second_url} == null ? null : $P{serverHost} + "/" + $P{ctx} + "/rtsApplication/getPdf.do?fp=" +    URLEncoder.encode(java.util.Base64.getEncoder().encodeToString($F{second_url}.getBytes("UTF-8")), "UTF-8")]]></hyperlinkReferenceExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="870" width="960" height="50" uuid="4b976a7d-5fdc-48aa-a579-0b777261d427">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement verticalAlignment="Bottom">
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["Declaration (घोषणा) :- The above mentioned information is true to the best of my knowledge and belief(वर नमूद केलेली माहिती माझ्या माहितीनुसार आणि विश्वासानुसार खरी आहे)."]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="414" width="960" height="50" uuid="b0fe1d28-1ea6-4231-88f2-02bc12147cc9">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["6. Will the members of committee be trained for First-aid, fire fighting equipment and safe evacuation of people in emergency situations?\nमंडपात इंधन प्रसादाकरिता स्वयंपाक घर तसेस फटाक्यांचा साथ करण्यात येणार आहे काय ? : "+($F{firecrackers} == null || $F{firecrackers}.isEmpty() ? "-" : $F{firecrackers})]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="465" width="960" height="50" uuid="4a9c6b75-b5de-49bf-9c13-ae5ce882e47e">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["7. Will all types of electrical equipment and wiring be done safely and as per the standards of the Electricity Department?\nसर्व प्रकारची विद्युत उपकरणे व तारांची जोडणी हि सुरक्षित तथा विद्युत विभागाच्या मानकाप्रमाणे करण्यात येणार आहे काय ? : "+($F{wiring} == null || $F{wiring}.isEmpty() ? "-" : $F{wiring})]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="516" width="960" height="50" uuid="af79ee72-e787-4823-999c-0aa7541b454d">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["8. Will alternate power arrangements be made available in the form of emergency generators?\nआपत्कालीन परिस्थिती जनरेटर च्या स्वरूपात पर्यायी विधुत व्यवस्था उपल उपलब्ध ठेवण्यात येणार आहे काय ? : "+($F{generators} == null || $F{generators}.isEmpty() ? "-" : $F{generators})]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="567" width="960" height="50" uuid="0076657a-e851-4a6f-a98d-f787a8c235fe">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["9. Will 2 Units of 5 kg fire extinguisher and 200 liter capacity water drum be kept in the mandap for fire fighting?\nअग्निशमन करीत २ नग ५ किलो फायर एक्स्टिंगशूर तसेच २०० लिटर क्षमतेचे पाण्याचे ? : "+($F{extinguisher} == null || $F{extinguisher}.isEmpty() ? "-" : $F{extinguisher})]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="619" width="960" height="50" uuid="b4c637e8-54a4-480d-b0b8-831c241274f0">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["10. Will the workers in the board be trained in first aid use of fire fighting equipment and safe evacuation of people in emergency situations?\nमंडळातील कार्यकर्त्यांना प्रथमाचार अग्निशमन साहित्य वापरण्यात तसेच आपत्कालीन परिस्थिती लोकांना सुखरूप बाहेर काढण्याकरिता प्रशिक्षण देण्यात येणार आहे काय ? : "+($F{trained} == null || $F{trained}.isEmpty() ? "-" : $F{trained})]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="671" width="960" height="60" uuid="6c627e81-3c54-425e-bfb6-542e7a121ee5">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["11. 2 Units of 5 kg capacity A B C type fire extinguishers and 200 liter capacity water drum will be kept in the pavilion for fire fighting? \nअग्निशमन करीत २ नग ५ किलो क्षमतेचे A B C type फायर एक्स्टिंगशूर तसेच २०० लिटर क्षमतेचे पाण्याचे ड्रम मंडपात ठेवण्यात येणार आहे काय ? : "+($F{pavilionfighting} == null || $F{pavilionfighting}.isEmpty() ? "-" : $F{pavilionfighting})]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="733" width="960" height="25" uuid="ae844d4c-8cca-499d-aace-fa76ea9c0844">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["12. Is permission taken for loudspeakers? लाऊड स्पीकर ची परवानगी घेतली आहे काय ? :"+($F{loudspeaker} == null || $F{loudspeaker}.isEmpty() ? "-" : $F{loudspeaker})]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="763" width="590" height="30" forecolor="#0B5E6B" uuid="3d021086-d7e1-4ae7-8377-3c94bca00198">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement verticalAlignment="Middle">
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="18" isBold="true" isItalic="true"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["List of Documents (with attachment) (दस्तऐवजांची यादी (संलग्नकांसह)) :"]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="595" y="763" width="365" height="30" uuid="9cc67329-a45b-479f-b921-dc58f1a4930d">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.y" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement verticalAlignment="Middle">
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["Note: Upload Below Files only .pdf(Max upto 2Mb) "]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="795" width="960" height="25" uuid="19e890f0-00b9-456c-9e31-00dcd977d301">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Left" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["1. Site Viewer Map with Detailed Information (तपशीलवार माहितीसह साइट दर्शक नकाशा) :"]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField hyperlinkType="Reference">
				<reportElement x="846" y="794" width="114" height="25" forecolor="#041EC7" uuid="b5e3c00c-87e5-4f38-a5e7-1ab66b8375d4">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Left" verticalAlignment="Middle">
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14" isBold="true" isItalic="false"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA[$F{first_url} == null ? "No file" : "Download PDF"]]></textFieldExpression>
				<hyperlinkReferenceExpression><![CDATA[$F{first_url} == null ? null : $P{serverHost} + "/" + $P{ctx} + "/rtsApplication/getPdf.do?fp=" +    URLEncoder.encode(java.util.Base64.getEncoder().encodeToString($F{first_url}.getBytes("UTF-8")), "UTF-8")]]></hyperlinkReferenceExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="118" width="960" height="30" forecolor="#09667D" uuid="40507d52-38f8-4aca-8a59-e522dc41edcd">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.y" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement verticalAlignment="Middle">
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="18" isBold="true" isItalic="true"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["Requirements for No Objection Certificate of Fire Department (अग्निशमन विभागाच्या ना हरकत प्रमाणपत्राची आवश्यकता)"]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="152" width="960" height="50" uuid="f74aa456-2660-4080-8bc9-306243f4bf4d">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["1. Is the height of the idol to be installed more than 4 feet? \nस्थापन करण्यात येणाऱ्या मूर्तीची उंची ४ फूट पेक्षा जास्त आहे काय ? : "+($F{idol} == null || $F{idol}.isEmpty() ? "-" : $F{idol})]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="203" width="960" height="50" uuid="2452aa44-ed3c-4f32-8dd3-f38f93dc5d47">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.x" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["2. Will the cloth, mat, wood, bamboo, wooden poles used in the tent be made fireproof?\nमंडपासाठी वापरण्यात येणारे साहित्य कापड, चटई ,लाकूड, बांबू ,लाकडी खांब हे आग प्रतिरोधक आहेत काय ? : "+($F{fireproof} == null || $F{fireproof}.isEmpty() ? "-" : $F{fireproof})]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="255" width="960" height="50" uuid="02de96f1-c318-4ccc-a4f6-763566a1fd19">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["3. Is there a minimum 9 meter wide path for fire fighting vehicles to reach the pavilion?\nमंडपात पोहचण्यास अग्निशमन वाहनाकरिता किमान ९ मीटर रुंदीचा मार्ग उपलब्ध आहे काय ? : "+($F{vehicle} == null || $F{vehicle}.isEmpty() ? "-" : $F{vehicle})]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="307" width="960" height="50" uuid="ea52ced4-897d-490d-928f-6b0d0d49e081">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["4. Will there be at least 4.50 meters free space around the mandap so that the fire does not spread in the surrounding buildings?\nआसपासच्या इमारती मध्ये आग पसरणार नाही याकरिता मंडपाच्या भोवताल किमान ४.५० मीटर मोकळी जागा आहे काय ? : "+($F{building} == null || $F{building}.isEmpty() ? "-" : $F{building})]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField>
				<reportElement x="0" y="360" width="960" height="50" uuid="0d2a8e22-d00b-481a-a66d-7bee2059743e">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.width" value="pixel"/>
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.x" value="pixel"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="14"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["5. Is there 3 meter wide gates/ways/doors available in opposite directions for safe evacuation of citizens in case of emergency?\nआपत्कालीन परिस्थितीत नागरिकांना सुरक्षित बाहेर काढण्याकरिता परस्पर विरुद्ध दिशेला ३ मीटर रुंदीचे गेट/मार्ग/दरवाजे उपलब्ध आहेत काय ? : "+($F{evacuation} == null || $F{evacuation}.isEmpty() ? "-" : $F{evacuation})]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
		</band>
	</detail>
</jasperReport>
